00:00:37.962 --> 00:00:38.670
WESLEY CHUN: Aha.

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:40.020
Glad you're a good sport.

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:41.880
We're doing three
migrations today,

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:43.980
all optional but recommended.

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:46.440
First, we're porting
from Python 2 to 3.

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:48.600
You probably should
move to Python 3,

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.670
since Python 2 has
been sunset and that's

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:53.160
where the community
has moved to, right?

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:55.890
Honestly, this app is already
compatible with both Python 2

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:58.990
and 3, so there's really not
much work to be done here.

00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:02.200
Next, moving to Cloud Tasks
is also pretty much a no-op--

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.200
meaning you don't really
need to change anything

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:05.880
