00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:45.510
like building a prototype to
see what these migrations entail

00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:49.500
and for you to consider before
doing these to your own apps.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:51.540
MARTIN OMANDER: OK,
those all make sense.

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:54.300
It's been a while since I've
