00:01:59.682 --> 00:02:00.390
WESLEY CHUN: Yep.

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:01.200
Sure, Martin.

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:04.290
Previously in module 8, we
migrated from App Engine task

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:05.790
queues to Cloud Tasks.

00:02:05.790 --> 00:02:07.860
Because migrating
to Cloud Firestore

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:10.620
